It's really not very good code. I don't want to have it in code that
I'm responsible for the whole year.

A lot of the code has been lifted from Slash'Em, only to get
indestructible doors. That one pollutes a lot of lines just for a
small feature.

The code to get a portal only when it's December is almost a verbatim
copy of the one for the Fort Ludios portal. That's also bad style (it
violates "Don't Repeat Yourself (unnecessarily)".

Finally, I didn't announce that patch as "Yet Another Silly Patch" for
nothing. I still like the idea and think it's nice for an online
server but I feel it's a bit over the top for an offline game.

